WEBVTT

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.330
The Lady Roses have not been coming
around here lately, have they?

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.230
Third-year students are busy studying
for college entrance exams.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.140
Say, who in the world is Rosa Canina?

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:18.840
Rosa... Canina?

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.780
A second-year student that
people call Rosa Canina...

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:23.440
...is apparently announcing her candidacy.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:25.050
Announcing her candidacy?

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:27.350
You mean, in the election for the
next Yamayuri Council officers?

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:28.150
What?

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:31.090
But I thought the three boutons
just inherit the positions...

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:34.860
...as next year's Yamayuri Council officers.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.200
Being a bouton does not mean...

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.100
...you can unconditionally become a Lady Rose.

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:45.370
The three Lady Roses, who are
the Yamayuri Council officers,

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:48.270
are chosen every year by a student vote.

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:51.510
So, if anyone wants to become one of them,

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:53.740
they can run as a candidate.

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:56.950
Then, depending on the results of the election,

00:00:56.950 --> 00:01:00.890
you might end up not being
the next Rosa Chinensis?

00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:02.150
Right.

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:06.550
That possibility also exists equally
for both Shimako and me.

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:09.960
Though the possibility may be equal,

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:12.300
I do believe the probabilities are different.

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:14.800
Shimako-san...

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:19.410
If this person called Rosa Canina
is a second-year student,

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:21.840
it may actually be more natural that way.

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:26.840
Right... Shimako-san is a bouton,
but she's a first-year student.

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:29.420
Do you mean to run away?

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:31.750
No.

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:34.950
I have no intention of doing so.

00:01:35.390 --> 00:01:38.660
For that would be to dishonor my Onee-sama,

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:40.320
who chose me as her little sister.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:44.060
What terribly half-hearted confidence.

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:52.540
The maidens, who flock to
Maria-sama's garden,

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:57.170
pass through the tall gates today yet
again with innocent, angelic smiles.

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:02.040
Their pure hearts and bodies are
clad in deep-colored uniforms.

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:05.180
So that the pleats of their
skirts are not disturbed...

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:08.410
...and so that their white sailor
collars are not set aflutter,

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:11.790
it is customary here to walk
slowly and with decorum.

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:17.330
The Private Lillian Girls' Academy,
a garden of maidens.

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:31.140
Maria Watches Over Us

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:53.920
Rosa Canina

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:01.260
Here you are.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:02.370
An Illustrated Guide
to the Japanese Flora

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:03.440
An Illustrated Guide
to the Japanese Flora
Thank you.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.410
Are you trying to look up a rose?

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:09.440
Yes, a rose called Rosa canina.

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:11.910
It was not in the illustrated guide I had, so...

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:15.450
There are many varieties of roses, after all.

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:17.970
What kind of flower do you think it is?

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:19.910
What kind?

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:24.050
The image I have of it is a blackish rose.

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:26.360
You're right.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:29.630
The Rosa canina is a black rose.

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:32.170
You can find it in that illustrated guide.

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:34.270
But that book is not available for checkout,

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:36.130
so please peruse it here, okay?

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:38.140
Fukuzawa Yumi-san...

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:40.140
All right.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:42.530
What? How did you know my name?

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:46.340
Traitor.

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:48.270
Yoshino-san!

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.850
Since when did you become
friendly with the enemy?

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:53.120
The enemy?

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:57.260
Our enemy would be Rosa Canina, right?

00:04:57.530 --> 00:05:02.360
Yes, that was why I thought I would
research the Rosa canina...

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:05.560
That person just now was Rosa Canina!

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:07.130
That person?

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.570
I've already checked into her.

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:12.970
Year 2, Wisteria Class, Kanina Shizuka-sama.

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:15.910
Student number 10. Library duty.

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:18.150
She's been in the choir since middle school...

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:21.150
...and at last year's school festival,
she gave a solo performance of an aria.

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:22.620
The prima donna of Lillian.

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:25.420
As a twist on her last name of Kanina,

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:28.950
her classmates apparently call her Rosa Canina.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:34.720
Oh, so there was no need to look up the rose...

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:37.020
This flower...

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:41.140
This is Rosa canina?!

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:02.520
Would you like another cup of tea?

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:05.590
I've had enough.

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:08.520
Shall I give you a shoulder massage?

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:11.390
That's all right. I'm not stiff anyway.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:17.000
If there is anything you would like me to do...

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:20.200
I'm fine at the moment.

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:24.440
Another sigh...

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:27.240
I wonder if she's tired.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:30.420
I'd like to at least...

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:33.790
...draw up posters for the election
with my Onee-sama, too.

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:38.180
But my Onee-sama does everything by herself.

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:45.800
Um, is there something troubling you?

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:50.630
It would be of no use to talk to you about it.

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:59.670
I know it wouldn't be possible
for me to solve her problems,

00:07:00.180 --> 00:07:02.740
but I thought I could at least be
someone she could vent to.

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:07.710
Shimako hasn't shown up.

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:12.120
She must feel reluctant to see us.

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:15.160
Because every time we see her, we press her,

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:17.360
"Aren't you going to run for Council?"

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:21.940
Kanina Shizuka-san was once
raised as a possible candidate...

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:23.630
...to be Rosa Gigantea's little sister, right?

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:24.660
What?

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:26.070
When was this?

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:28.230
Before you two entered high school.

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:30.670
That is a mere rumor.

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.940
Rosa Canina and Rosa Gigantea?

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:43.050
Oh, Yumi-san.

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:46.090
Rosa Canina!

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:49.120
Are you coming from cleaning the music room?

00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:51.300
Yes. Are you here for choir?

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:53.100
You are here early.

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:57.500
Yes, on the days we meet,
I rush here when I finish cleaning.

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:01.160
Because I love the music room
when no one else is there.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:04.480
I've even passed you in the hall
here every once in a while.

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:06.710
What? Really?

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.910
Just as I thought, you didn't remember me then.

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:11.240
Pardon me.

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:12.720
It's fine.

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:16.720
Let's call it even with my lie.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.050
Are you referring to the thing
about the black rose?

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:24.030
It would've been fancier if
it really were a black rose.

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:24.960
Bye now.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:28.100
Oh, Yumi-chan.

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:30.640
Rosa Gigantea!

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:34.400
What a pretty girl. A friend of yours?

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:35.400
Huh?

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:37.910
What kind of silly response is that?

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:40.810
I'm talking about the
student you were just with.

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:46.250
Are you not aware?

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:49.180
That was Rosa Canina,
whom everyone is talking about.

00:08:49.890 --> 00:08:50.980
Oh!

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:52.920
Wait, what are you talking about?

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:56.860
Huh, so she's the one wanting to audition...

00:08:56.860 --> 00:08:58.920
...to be a Yamayuri Council officer.

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:02.060
It is an election, not an audition, you know.

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:04.000
I don't see anything wrong with it.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:05.600
She is pretty, after all.

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:06.900
Hol...

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:10.070
Hold on a moment, please, Rosa Gigantea!

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:12.850
Normally, in a situation like this,

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:16.370
shouldn't you be putting your support
behind Shimako-san, your little sister?

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:19.980
But Shimako hasn't stepped
forward as a candidate, right?

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:23.650
Then, why not give the job
to the person who wants it?

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:25.150
That's not what I meant.

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:28.660
Shouldn't you be the one to
talk Shimako-san into running?

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:31.400
Did Shimako say she wants to be talked into it?

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:36.340
There is... no way she would ever say that.

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:37.740
You know Shimako-san.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:39.300
Then I'm not going to talk her into it.

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:43.300
Besides, third-year students don't
even have the right to vote.

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:46.840
I don't want to get dragged into
something so troublesome.

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:50.110
Why are you so cold?

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:55.690
Shimako-san is your little sister, Rosa Gigantea.

00:09:57.460 --> 00:10:01.130
Yes, Shimako is my little sister,

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:05.690
but I don't think she absolutely
needs to become the Rosa Gigantea.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:10.140
If she wants the position, she can
do something about it on her own...

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:11.930
...and if she doesn't, she can just not run.

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:13.640
It's a simple matter.

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:19.910
That is so...

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:22.140
You are her soeur...

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:26.720
You are her soeur and you would
just silently stand by and watch?

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:28.880
That is beyond sad...

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:32.720
It's nothing for you to cry over, is it?

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:35.750
I'm only saying that I'm
not going to do anything.

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:40.390
So, it's your own business
if you want to get involved.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:44.230
See you later.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:56.080
It's too bad that we can't have
lunch outside in the winter.

00:10:57.950 --> 00:10:59.280
It's so quiet...

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.250
Are you not going to run?

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:08.120
I'm actually not sure.

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:11.960
Do you mind if I ask you why?

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:16.170
It was not as if I became
Rosa Gigantea's little sister...

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:19.000
...because I wanted to be on the student council.

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:23.470
It just so happened that my
Onee-sama was a Lady Rose.

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:28.440
And to be of use to her, I have helped
out with the Yamayuri Council.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:33.920
So the truth is, once my Onee-sama graduates,

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.790
I will have no qualms about
leaving the Yamayuri Council.

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:37.780
Shimako-san...

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:39.690
I'm sorry.

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:44.530
To me, belonging to some group
only means being fettered.

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:47.700
I want to be as unencumbered as possible.

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:49.030
That is my wish.

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:52.970
But it is probably precisely
because that is how I am...

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:56.770
...that Rosa Gigantea pulled
me into the Yamayuri Council.

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:01.750
It's vague, but I feel like
I'm beginning to understand...

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:03.650
...the relationship between
the White Rose sisters.

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:08.820
I'm very happy to have become
friends with you and Yoshino-san,

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:10.760
and if I had not joined the Yamayuri Council,

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:14.080
I would've never formed
such bonds with other people.

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:15.890
Then...

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:21.220
But I'm not the sort of person
who can lead other students...

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:22.500
...and besides...

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:26.330
Yes?

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.440
Good day, Yumi-san.

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:32.910
Rosa Canina!

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:42.180
I have come today to speak with Shimako-san.

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:50.960
Maria Watches Over Us

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:56.570
I shall hear what you have to say.

00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:59.740
Why have you not announced your candidacy?

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:02.200
The deadline is after school today.

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:08.280
I do not believe what I do is a
matter for me to discuss with you.

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:09.470
You're right.

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:13.150
But if you are feeling burdened...

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:17.120
...at the thought of becoming the Rosa
Gigantea as a second-year student,

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:19.490
make use of me, just for next year.

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:22.860
Fortunately, I have no little sister.

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:26.700
After the current Rosa Gigantea has graduated,

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:30.160
I intend to take you as my soeur.

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:36.110
You will be guaranteed the seat of
Rosa Gigantea two years from now.

00:13:36.640 --> 00:13:39.480
I do not think, by any means,
that it is a bad bargain.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:41.040
Please think about it.

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:43.210
Please wait.

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:46.280
I can give you my answer
regarding at least this much.

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:48.310
What is it?

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:50.290
No matter what happens,

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:53.260
I have no intention of becoming your little sister.

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:56.300
And that is true for anyone else as well.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:01.230
My Onee-sama is Rosa Gigantea
and Rosa Gigantea alone.

00:14:03.140 --> 00:14:05.230
I see. I understand.

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:13.210
That day after school,

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:16.270
Shimako-san gave her notification
of her intention to be a candidate.

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:19.650
And after a week of campaigning,

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:23.280
the day came for the four candidates
to give their speeches.

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:25.160
In the end,

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:28.250
I never figured out what I should've
done in the days that led up to today...

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:31.090
...and my Onee-sama is as cheerless as ever.

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:33.230
Onee-sama!

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:37.370
Good day, Sachiko. Have you been well?

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:40.070
Yes, of course!

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:41.470
Really? I'm glad to hear it.

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:51.580
It was because she got
to see Rosa Chinensis...

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:53.980
I'm of no use.

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:01.360
Yumi-chan.

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:04.660
Did something happen?

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:07.860
I...

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:11.900
I am incapable of doing
anything for Sachiko-sama.

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:16.370
Even though I am her little sister...

00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:18.240
That's fine, Yumi-chan.

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:20.310
You see,

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:23.150
a little sister doesn't need to
worry about such things.

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:25.310
Because, you're the little sister.

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:26.520
What?

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:29.010
If you want to be of help in some way,

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:30.550
behave normally.

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:35.120
And if Sachiko comes to you,
asking you to do something,

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:37.220
only then do you need to do just that.

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:39.630
Is that really enough?

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:42.100
It is.

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:45.540
I'm the one saying it, and I've
been a big sister for a long time,

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:46.900
so there is no doubt.

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:48.910
Do you understand?

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:50.600
Yes.

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:54.340
Come, Sachiko is waiting for you.

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:05.760
Yumi, where were you?

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:07.130
Pardon me.

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:10.290
Yumi, did something happen?

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:14.090
Onee-sama, what is there that I can do?

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:19.230
I wanted to do something for you,
but I could think of nothing...

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:21.500
...and I felt so wretched for it.

00:16:21.610 --> 00:16:22.700
So, I...

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:26.850
Is it because you were thinking of such things...

00:16:26.850 --> 00:16:28.870
...that you have looked
somewhat downcast lately?

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:32.220
I can't believe it.

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:35.650
So we soeurs were tormented
by the same thought.

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:36.890
The same?

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:42.620
The truth is, I was agonizing
over my Onee-sama, too.

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:46.370
Hoping to do something for my Onee-sama...

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:48.500
...as she studied for her
college entrance exams,

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:50.270
I gave it a lot of thought.

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:53.670
But ultimately, I came to the
realization that I could do nothing...

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:55.370
...and I had grown despondent.

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:58.410
But you see, my Onee-sama
came by earlier and told me,

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:01.410
"I came by to see your face."

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:03.880
And that completely lifted my spirits.

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:08.520
Why? Because I realized that what
my Onee-sama wants from me...

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:13.080
...is the same as what I want from you, Yumi.

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:14.820
From me?

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:17.660
I only need you to be by my side.

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:20.670
The Rosa Chinensis spoke of it thus,

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:23.530
that it is the big sister,
who shelters and protects,

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:26.100
and the little sister is her support.

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:29.110
The little sister is her support...

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:34.570
I need a little sister who will be there for me.

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:37.910
Stay by my side...

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:41.060
...and when I become lonely every so often,

00:17:41.060 --> 00:17:43.020
hold my hands for me.

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:49.290
Shimako.

00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:51.820
Onee-sama.

00:17:56.140 --> 00:17:58.330
I did not force you into this.

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:02.570
Ultimately, this is something
you decided for yourself.

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:06.270
If you're elected, make sure you
see this through to the end.

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:14.090
Wasn't Rosa Gigantea mistaken
in her choice of words?

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:16.480
It's fine, Yumi-san.

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:20.360
What my Onee-sama just said...

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:23.350
...were the greatest words
of encouragement to me.

00:18:25.170 --> 00:18:27.900
I just can't understand these two...

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:31.000
Next,

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:34.700
we have a speech from Ogasawara
Sachiko-san of Year 2, Pine Class.

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:38.870
Yumi, watch me from here.

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:44.380
I will be sure to watch.

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:46.910
I am Sachiko-sama's support.

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:51.620
And on the day the election
results were announced,

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:54.330
all of the boutons, including
Sachiko-sama, of course,

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:56.460
were formally chosen to be the Lady Roses.

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:08.300
I'm here, as promised.

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:10.630
Thank you very much.

00:19:12.010 --> 00:19:13.840
Did you see the results of the election?

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:16.840
The results do not matter.

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:20.050
Well, you did say that you wanted to
see me after school on Saturday,

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:23.850
regardless of the outcome of the election.

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:28.480
To me, what is more important than anything...

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:32.430
...is that I am before you,
here and now, in this moment.

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:36.430
So, the election was just a pretext?

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:39.430
Maybe it was for me to try my luck.

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:43.970
Because I didn't want to leave
without taking some kind of action.

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:47.210
I'm going to Italy.

00:19:47.650 --> 00:19:48.580
Italy?

00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:50.750
To study music.

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:55.750
In truth, I had intended to enroll after
graduating from middle school,

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:59.280
but I ended up postponing it by two years.

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:00.460
Why?

00:20:01.900 --> 00:20:03.290
Because you were here.

00:20:05.070 --> 00:20:07.660
Even if it was only for a moment,

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:12.070
I wanted you to see me as
you are seeing me now.

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:15.610
You are an enchanting person, Rosa Canina.

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:19.440
If we could have met each other a little sooner,

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:21.810
perhaps we could have been friends.

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:24.850
You would not have made me your little sister?

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:26.750
Did you want to be?

00:20:29.690 --> 00:20:32.630
I am not Shimako-san, after all.

00:20:33.990 --> 00:20:35.960
Rosa... Canina...

00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:40.360
Won't you please call me "Shizuka"?

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:52.440
A parting gift.

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:06.220
Hey, it's not nice to spy on people.

00:21:07.460 --> 00:21:08.590
I'm sorry!

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:12.370
But I saw you by the bulletin board
and when I came after you,

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:13.260
it just so happened that...

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:16.030
Oh, I won't tell Shimako-san.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:18.440
I don't really care if you do.

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:19.900
Rosa Gigantea.

00:21:20.970 --> 00:21:23.270
To all three of you,
congratulations on being elected.

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:25.310
Thank you very much.
Thank you very much.

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:27.540
You won easily.

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:30.780
That is not entirely true...

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:35.180
Well then, we'll be going now.

00:21:35.660 --> 00:21:37.280
Yumi, let us go.

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:44.530
Onee-sama...

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:49.530
Let's let Rosa Gigantea behave
in a sisterly fashion for once.

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:53.810
She may appear strong,

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:56.440
but Shimako is still a first-year
student, the same as you,

00:21:56.780 --> 00:21:58.400
so I'm sure she was nervous.

00:21:59.610 --> 00:22:02.780
I was quite tense myself.

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:05.370
I shall do anything.

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:07.890
Please ask whatever you like of me.

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:12.080
Then, please make me a hot cup
of tea at the Rose Mansion.

00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:14.160
I shall, Onee-sama.

