What'll I do? What'll I do?

00:23:27.570 --> 00:23:27.870
It don't matter which, just make up yer mind!
What'll I do? What'll I do?

00:23:27.870 --> 00:23:29.340
It don't matter which, just make up yer mind!

00:23:29.340 --> 00:23:31.340
Aw, sis, that was harsh.

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:32.670
Maria-sama's watchin' ya.
